    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>General Feat (Prerequisite: Level 4+, Mark of Finding Feat)</em></p><p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> Increase one ability score of your choice by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p><p><strong>Improved Intuition.</strong> When you use the Hunter's Intuition benefit of your Mark of Finding feat, you can roll 1d6 instead of 1d4.</p><p><strong>Improved Finding.</strong> When you use the Finder's Magic benefit of your Mark of Finding feat to cast Hunter's Mark without a spell slot, the spell's range is doubled, and you can modify it so that the target can't benefit from the Invisible condition for the duration.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-GDQTVXCxrW8lcPdx\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Improved Intuition: change the bonus of the <em>Hunter's Intuition</em> effect of your Mark of Finding feat from 1d4 to 1d6.</p></section>",
